  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners Innovation Fund: Mozambique &#x2013; 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Orange Corners Innovation Fund (OCIF) provides young entrepreneurs in the Orange Corners programme with access to funding of up to &#x20ac;50,000. This allows the entrepreneurs to develop their idea in a product or proposition that can enter the market.As OCIF aims to stimulate innovation, the innovative-aspect of the business will be an important criterium for the selection of participants in the programme. It will be a condition that each business idea will have positive social or ecological impact and addresses at least one Social Development Goal (SDG).Furthermore, each entrepreneur will have to commit him or herself fully for the period of the incubation programme. If a business idea fits within the circular economy, this will be a big plus.</narrative>
  </description>
